  data: {
    LLM: 'Prioritize Civil pairs early as they are easier to recognize. Keep the Supreme pair (tiles 1-2 and 2-4) if you find them—they are rare and valuable.\n\nEfficiency: If you have a Military tile like 6-1, keep an eye out for its counterparts 5-2 or 4-3. Knowing the pip totals is essential for speed.\n\nDiscard Management: Watch what tiles others are discarding. If both 1-1 tiles have been discarded, any remaining single 1-1 is a dead tile and should be discarded immediately.',
